# Butler Routes - The Hinterlands completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Hinterlands Alliance quest in the local census (14 quests,
# docs/the-hinterlands-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once
# as a turnin. No race header: nothing contracted is race-locked, and there
# are no class or profession quests in the set, so no per-line gates either.
# Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept; the one out-of-contract pre
# (1451 for 1452) is a note plus a listed structural warning. The item-started
# beacon never wedges (note at Skulk Rock, sourcing optional); the three
# sourceless writs and the three crafted turn-ins take the Ashenvale R5
# handling (optional + bag note). Jammal'an, the satchel, and the gryphon eggs
# have no placed spawns in the data, so those three completes carry no place -
# honest notes, never invented points. Coordinates use the era frame the data
# carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-hinterlands
title The Hinterlands - Completionist
levels 38-51
zone The Hinterlands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Aerie Peak - landfall

  note Aerie Peak is the hub: Gryphon Master Talonaxe holds the flight point, Innkeeper Thulfram the inn. Set hearth at Thulfram when you pass him.
  goto 9.75,44.47 -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe

step Aerie Peak - bounties and errands

  accept 2877 -- Skulk Rock Clean-up - Fraggar Thundermantle; sludges and oozes at Skulk Rock, east (below)
  accept 2880 -- Troll Necklace Bounty - Fraggar Thundermantle; tribal necklaces off the Witherbark west and the Vilebranch east (below)
  note The twin 2881 accepts after 2880 turns in (below) - same bounty, second round.
  accept 86615 -- Treaty Obligations - Tove Redstone; her satchel in Wildhammer Keep (below)
  accept 86616 -- Repurposed Totems - Farseer Maret Firetend; totems off the Vilebranch Soothsayers north-center (below)
  accept 86620 -- Fledgling Rescue - Gryphon Master Talonaxe; lost gryphon eggs (below)

step Wildhammer Keep - satchel and eggs

  complete 86615 -- Diplomatic Satchel (Wildhammer Keep; the satchel object is not in the data, so this complete carries no place)
  note Tove Redstone's satchel should be in Wildhammer Keep, but no satchel object exists in the local data - check the keep halls by hand.
  complete 86620 -- Lost Gryphon Eggs (no egg object exists in the local data, so this complete carries no place)
  note The lost gryphon eggs have no placed spawns in the data - check around the Aerie Peak razorbeak grounds by hand.
  turnin 86615 -- Treaty Obligations - the satchel to Tove Redstone
  turnin 86620 -- Fledgling Rescue - the eggs to Gryphon Master Talonaxe

step Rhapsody's camp - the kocktail

  note Rhapsody's chain starts outside this guide: pick up 1450/1451 from Falstad Wildhammer and Gryphon Master Talonaxe first (not routed in any guide - above Hillsbrad's band). This guide continues from 1452.
  accept 1452 -- Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail - Rhapsody Shindigger; rocs in Tanaris, bears and apes in Feralas (expedition below)
  accept 94290 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mechanical Repair Kit - sourceless writ in the bags; the kit is crafted (bag note below)
  note Writ 94290 starts from a writ item with no source in the data - check the bags; its turnin rides the Rhapsody closing step below.

step Witherbark - necklaces, first round

  goto 21.75,57.54 -- Witherbark Scalper ground (west)
  goto 23.69,56.62 -- Witherbark Scalper ground (west)
  kill 2649 optional -- Witherbark Scalper for Troll Tribal Necklaces
  complete 2880 @21.75,57.54 -- Troll Tribal Necklaces (Witherbark, west)
  turnin 2880 -- Troll Necklace Bounty - the necklaces to Fraggar Thundermantle (Aerie Peak)
  accept 2881 -- Troll Necklace Bounty - Fraggar Thundermantle; same bounty, second round
  complete 2881 @23.69,56.62 -- Troll Tribal Necklaces, second round (Witherbark, west)
  turnin 2881 -- Troll Necklace Bounty - the necklaces to Fraggar Thundermantle

step Jintha'Alor - the exile

  accept 1446 -- Jammal'an the Prophet - Atal'ai Exile; the Head of Jammal'an (below)
  complete 1446 -- Head of Jammal'an (Jammal'an has no spawn point in the data anywhere, so this complete carries no place - honest note; the fight belongs to Jintha'Alor)
  note Jammal'an the Prophet carries the head, but the data holds no spawn point for him anywhere - check the Jintha'Alor altar by hand.
  turnin 1446 -- Jammal'an the Prophet - the head to the Atal'ai Exile

step Skulk Rock - sludges and the robot

  goto 43.8,43.8 -- Green Sludge ground (Skulk Rock)
  goto 44.66,42.92 -- Jade Ooze ground (Skulk Rock)
  kill 2655 optional -- Green Sludge
  kill 2656 optional -- Jade Ooze
  complete 2877 @43.8,43.8 -- Green Sludges and Jade Oozes (Skulk Rock)
  goto 49.35,37.66 -- Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
  note The OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon drops from Hinterlands trolls, wolves, owls, and snapjaws - kill anything on the way; the sourcing below is one convenient cluster.
  kill 2659 optional -- Razorbeak Skylord for the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon
  accept 485 -- Find OOX-09/HL! - the beacon; the homing robot waits here
  turnin 485 -- Find OOX-09/HL! - the beacon to the Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
  accept 836 -- Rescue OOX-09/HL! - the homing robot; escort east, then Booty Bay (below)

step North - vilebranch totems

  goto 44.57,65.48 -- Vilebranch Soothsayer ground (north-center)
  goto 47.56,66.49 -- Vilebranch Soothsayer ground (north-center)
  kill 4467 optional -- Vilebranch Soothsayer for Vilebranch Totems
  complete 86616 @44.57,65.48 -- Vilebranch Totems (north-center)

step East - escort and writs

  complete 836 @79.14,61.36 -- Escort OOX-09/HL to the shoreline beyond Overlook Cliff
  note The robot walks itself; meet it at the shoreline, then report to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay (below).
  accept 94266 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Agility - sourceless writ in the bags; the elixir is crafted (bag note below)
  accept 94302 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Turtle Scale Breastplate - sourceless writ in the bags; the breastplate is crafted (bag note below)
  note Writs 94266 and 94302 start from writ items with no source in the data - check the bags. Their crafted goods ride the bags too (Ashenvale R5 handling).
  goto 80.13,55.39 -- Juo
  turnin 94266 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Agility - the goods to Juo
  turnin 94302 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Turtle Scale Breastplate - the goods to Juo

step Booty Bay expedition - OOX delivery

  zone map 1434

  turnin 836 -- Rescue OOX-09/HL! - the robot's word to Oglethorpe Obnoticus
  note The follow-up 3721 accepts here in Booty Bay - the Stranglethorn guide owns it, not this one.

step Aerie Peak return - loose ends

  zone map 1425

  turnin 2877 -- Skulk Rock Clean-up - the sludge word to Fraggar Thundermantle (Aerie Peak)
  turnin 86616 -- Repurposed Totems - the totems to Farseer Maret Firetend (Aerie Peak)

step Kalimdor expedition - Rhapsody's ingredients

  zone map 1446

  goto 36.71,34.84 -- Roc ground (Tanaris)
  goto 40.37,35.58 -- Roc ground (Tanaris)
  kill 5429 optional -- Fire Roc for Roc Gizzards
  complete 1452 @36.71,34.84 -- Roc Gizzards (Tanaris)

  zone map 1444

  goto 54.73,52.75 -- Ironfur Bear ground (Feralas)
  goto 57.09,60.06 -- Ironfur Bear ground (Feralas)
  kill 5268 optional -- Ironfur Bear for Ironfur Livers
  complete 1452 @54.73,52.75 -- Ironfur Livers (Feralas)
  goto 56.3,54.93 -- Groddoc Ape ground (Feralas)
  goto 56.51,60.11 -- Groddoc Ape ground (Feralas)
  kill 5260 optional -- Groddoc Ape for Groddoc Livers
  complete 1452 @56.3,54.93 -- Groddoc Livers (Feralas)

step Rhapsody closing - kocktail, tale, and Stormwind

  zone map 1425

  turnin 1452 -- Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail - the ingredients to Rhapsody Shindigger
  turnin 94290 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mechanical Repair Kit - the kit to Rhapsody Shindigger
  accept 1469 -- Rhapsody's Tale - Rhapsody Shindigger; the tablet fragment to Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind (below)

  zone map 1453

  turnin 1469 -- Rhapsody's Tale - the fragment to Brohann Caskbelly
